{
  "about": "幕轨道（第 22 条，作者已定 11-11）真窗口往返验收：新建幕轨道 → 在里面建条目 → 拖一个外部条目进来 → 拉长短 → 关掉重开，数据都在。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "seed": "tiny"
    },
    {
      "call": "book.list",
      "save": "books"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "all": true
      },
      "save": "entries"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${entries.[template=tpl-idea].id}"
      },
      "save": "source"
    },
    {
      "launch": {
        "settings": {
          "device": {
            "modules": {
              "first_run.done": true,
              "guides.seen": [
                "workspace-tour"
              ]
            }
          },
          "account": {
            "language.ui_locale": "en"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "book.open",
      "params": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000,
        "state": {
          "/book/version": 3,
          "/bottom/pane": "timeline"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "Add lane",
        "role": "Button"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "New act track",
        "role": "MenuItem"
      },
      "note": "1. 新建幕轨道：在树顶层创建 Acts 层级并加入当前视图顶部。"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Lane Acts",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "act_lane"
    },
    {
      "call": "timeline_view.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "after_track",
      "expect": {
        "/0/lanes/0/act_track": true
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${after_track.0.lanes.0.entry}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "/title": "Acts",
        "/template": "tpl-act-track",
        "/parent": null
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "New entry",
        "role": "Button"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "New entry",
        "role": "MenuItem"
      },
      "note": "2. 在幕轨道里新建条目：默认用构想叶子模板住在幕下，并直接赋予区间长度。"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Untitled",
        "role": "Button",
        "within": {
          "label": "Lane Acts",
          "role": "Group"
        },
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "Place entry",
        "role": "Button"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "Acts",
        "role": "MenuItem"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "${source.title}",
        "role": "Button",
        "count": 1,
        "within": {
          "label": "Place entry",
          "role": "Group"
        }
      },
      "save": "pick"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Lane Acts",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "act_lane_now"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "20",
        "role": "StaticText"
      },
      "save": "tick20"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": [
          "${pick.nodes.0.center.0}",
          "${pick.nodes.0.center.1}"
        ],
        "to": [
          "${tick20.nodes.0.center.0}",
          "${act_lane_now.nodes.0.center.1}"
        ],
        "steps": 12
      },
      "note": "3. 拖一个外部条目进幕轨道：原住处不变，无 span 先画成短段。"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "${source.title}",
        "role": "Button",
        "within": {
          "label": "Lane Acts",
          "role": "Group"
        },
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${source.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "/parent": "${source.parent}",
        "/pos": "${source.pos}",
        "/primary": "${source.primary}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Adjust length",
        "role": "Slider",
        "within": {
          "label": "${source.title}",
          "role": "Group"
        },
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "resize_handle"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "40",
        "role": "StaticText"
      },
      "save": "tick40"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": [
          "${resize_handle.nodes.0.center.0}",
          "${resize_handle.nodes.0.center.1}"
        ],
        "to": [
          "${tick40.nodes.0.center.0}",
          "${act_lane_now.nodes.0.center.1}"
        ],
        "steps": 12
      },
      "note": "4. 拉长短：把外部短段向右拉成带跨度的区间条。"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "timeline_view.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "before_quit_views"
    },
    {
      "call": "membership.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "before_quit_memberships"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000,
        "state": {
          "/v3/timeline_views": "${before_quit_views}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.screenshot",
      "png": "01-act-track-before-quit.png"
    },
    {
      "app": "app.quit"
    },
    {
      "launch": {
        "settings": {
          "account": {
            "language.ui_locale": "en"
          }
        }
      },
      "note": "5. 关掉重开：核对幕轨道、新建条目、外部归属条目及拉出的区间长度全部原样在盘。"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "book.open",
      "params": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000,
        "state": {
          "/book/version": 3,
          "/bottom/pane": "timeline",
          "/v3/timeline_views": "${before_quit_views}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "timeline_view.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "": "${before_quit_views}"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "membership.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "": "${before_quit_memberships}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Lane Acts",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Untitled",
        "role": "Button",
        "within": {
          "label": "Lane Acts",
          "role": "Group"
        },
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "${source.title}",
        "role": "Button",
        "within": {
          "label": "Lane Acts",
          "role": "Group"
        },
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.screenshot",
      "png": "02-act-track-after-reopen.png"
    },
    {
      "app": "app.quit"
    }
  ]
}
